    title:'Production & Facility — Merpolon | Merteks Elastomer',
    eyebrow:'Production & Facility',
    h1:'In our own plant,<br/>under engineer control',
    lede:'At our facility in the İkitelli OIZ we run the whole process — from steel core machining to covering, from grinding to quality control — under one roof. Continuous machinery and R&D investment keeps production high in quality and fair in price.',
